{"id":"8736a0ad823f4cb0","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-finite-jump.md","title":"Finite Iterates of the Turing Jump","display":"df-finite-jump — Finite Iterates of the Turing Jump","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-finite-jump","aliases":["62-df-finite-jump"],"display":"df-finite-jump — Finite Iterates of the Turing Jump","depends_on":["[[62-df-jump-operator]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remark I.3.4; Definition VIII.1.9","source_pages":[8,312],"source_pdf_pages":[26,330]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-finite-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-finite-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-jump — Finite Iterates of the Turing Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4d648cbb987de36\" href=\"?note=d4d648cbb987de36\" title=\"62-df-jump-operator\">62-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remark I.3.4; Definition VIII.1.9"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>312</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>330</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 均在标准元理论中解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf J\">\\(\\mathsf J\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d648cbb987de36\" href=\"?note=d4d648cbb987de36\" title=\"62-df-jump-operator\">62-df-jump-operator</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf J^0(A)\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\\mathsf J^{n+1}(A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf J(\\mathsf J^n(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf J^0(A)\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\\mathsf J^{n+1}(A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf J(\\mathsf J^n(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿元理论自然数递归，存在与唯一由外部集合递归得到。ACA₀ 对每个固定标准 n 证明有限跳跃存在；这不等于证明一个集合同时编码全部 n 的跳跃，也不定义任意序数处的“无条件并集跳跃”。这种区别用于 ARITH 与 ATR₀ 的分离。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Remark I.3.4; Definition VIII.1.9；纸面页 8, 312；PDF 页 26, 330。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d4d648cbb987de36","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d4d648cbb987de36","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$、$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 均在标准元理论中解释；$\\mathsf J$ 见 [[62-df-jump-operator]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf J^0(A)\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\\mathsf J^{n+1}(A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf J(\\mathsf J^n(A)).","display":true}],"bytes":1187,"backlinks":[{"id":"e2d400eef79d26fb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数集之间的归约见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]，有限标准跳跃见 [[62-df-finite-jump]]。以下是元理论中的子集族。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-finite-jump|Finite Iterates of the Turing Jump]]"}],"outgoing":["d4d648cbb987de36"]}